/* Hedgerow — boot, menus and the frame loop.

   URL switches for testing: ?debug (stats overlay), ?god (no damage),
   ?fly (free camera, no soldiers), ?at=x,z (start somewhere else),
   ?go (skip the menus straight to the briefing). */

